{% comment %}
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
  BACKDROPSOURCE — CONTACT US  (Shopify 2.0 section)
  File: sections/contactus.liquid   ·  Faithful conversion of contactus.html
  ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
  - Hero  : "Get expert backdrop advice" + consultant photo (Call.jpg asset)
  - Form  : NATIVE Shopify contact form. Submissions are emailed to the
            address in  Admin -> Settings -> Notifications -> "Contact form".
            To deliver to 2-3 people, point that address at a group/alias
            (e.g. team@yourdomain.com) or add a forwarding rule.
  - Nav/footer are omitted on purpose; the theme header/footer provide them.
    All CSS is scoped under .bds-contact so the global reset never touches
    the theme header/footer.
  ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
{% endcomment %}

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com"/>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin/>
